flowchart LR
    U[User] -->|"/workshop"| W[workshop skill\nInterviews user, writes spec]
    W --> SPEC[docs/specs/&lt;slug&gt;.md]
    SPEC -->|"/orchestrator &lt;spec&gt;"| P[orchestrator: 1. Prepare\nwrites tmp/team/handoff.md]

    P --> TYPE{spec Type?}
    TYPE -->|BUG or TICKET| TR[ticket-reviewer agent\nVerify reproduction]
    TYPE -->|FEATURE| DESIGNCHECK

    TR --> STATUS{STATUS}
    STATUS -->|REPRODUCED| DESIGNCHECK{UI/UX surface?}
    STATUS -->|NOT REPRODUCED or BLOCKED| STOP[Stop, report to user]

    DESIGNCHECK -->|yes| DES[designer agent\nwrites tmp/team/design.md]
    DESIGNCHECK -->|no| IMPL[3. Implement]
    DES --> IMPL

    IMPL --> BE[backend-engineer agent]
    IMPL --> FE[frontend-engineer agent]

    BE --> RQ[4. Review and QA\nrun in parallel]
    FE --> RQ

    RQ --> CR[code-reviewer agent\nreview-round-N.md]
    RQ --> QA[qa-tester agent\nqa-round-N.md]

    CR --> VERDICT{both CLEAN\nsame round?}
    QA --> VERDICT
    VERDICT -->|no, findings| IMPL
    VERDICT -->|yes| DOC[5. Document\nwriter agent]

    DOC --> REPORT[6. Report to user]
